## 1. Schema Evolution Overview

### v1.0 Schema (Existing)
```
causes (3 columns core)
donations (14 columns)
admin_users (6 columns)
```

### v2.0 Schema (Target)
```
users (NEW — replaces admin_users concept)
donation_profiles (NEW — extends causes)
donations (EXTENDED — new columns)
payment_logs (NEW)
verification_requests (NEW)
tax_receipts (NEW)
subscriptions (NEW)
campaign_progress (NEW)
impact_reports (NEW)
causes (PRESERVED — backward compat)
admin_users (PRESERVED — backward compat)
```

