## 4. Status Enums

### Verification Status (`donation_profiles.verification_status`)
| Status | Description | Triggered By |
|---|---|---|
| `draft` | Campaign created, not submitted | Creator creates campaign |
| `pending` | Submitted for verification | Creator submits with documents |
| `verified` | Admin approved | Admin approves |
| `rejected` | Admin rejected | Admin rejects with reason |
| `suspended` | Admin suspended post-verification | Admin suspends |

### Subscription Status (`subscriptions.status`)
| Status | Description | Triggered By |
|---|---|---|
| `active` | Subscription active, payments ongoing | Successful subscription creation |
| `paused` | Temporarily paused (failed payments) | 3 consecutive payment failures |
| `cancelled` | User-initiated cancellation | User cancels |
| `expired` | Campaign ended | Campaign end date passed |

### Donation Status (Extended from v1.0)
| Status | Description | v1.0? |
|---|---|---|
| `initiated` | Order created | ✅ |
| `pending` | Payment completed, verifying | ✅ |
| `completed` | Payment confirmed | ✅ |
| `failed` | Payment failed | ✅ |
| `refunded` | Payment refunded | ✅ |
| `recurring` | Part of active subscription | ✅ New |

