## 8. Database Rules (v2.0)

1. No hard deletes — use `is_active` flag or `cancelled_at` timestamp.
2. Financial records (`donations`, `payment_logs`, `tax_receipts`) are **immutable**.
3. Every record has `created_at` (and `updated_at` where applicable).
4. All foreign keys explicitly defined with appropriate ON DELETE behavior.
5. Indexes on all frequently queried columns.
6. `raised_amount` updated via trigger, never by direct client write.
7. Status transitions follow defined state machines.
8. RLS enabled on ALL tables — no exceptions.
9. `documents_url` stored as TEXT array — actual files in Supabase Storage.
10. `statistics_json` uses JSONB for flexible AI report data.
